    {
      "source": "Default implementation of <a href=\"ScriptExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.script\"><code>ScriptExecutor</code></a>. Optimizes performance by attempting to execute script first using\nevalsha, then falling back to eval if Redis has not yet cached the script. Evalsha is not attempted if the script is\nexecuted in a pipeline or transaction.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ScriptExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.script\"><code>ScriptExecutor</code></a> 的默认实现。通过尝试首先使用 evalsha 执行脚本，并在 Redis 尚未缓存该脚本时回退到 eval，从而优化性能。如果脚本在管道或事务中执行，则不会尝试使用 evalsha。",
      "count": 1
    },
